{"unit_id":"tag:00VK:statement","translation":"设 <MATH_0001> 为群（group）。考虑范畴（category）<MATH_0002>，其对象（objects）是集合（sets）<MATH_0003>，配以左（left）<MATH_0004>-作用（action），而 <MATH_0005>-等变（equivariant）映射（maps）作为态射（morphisms）。一个重要的例子是 <MATH_0006>，它是一个 <MATH_0007>-集合（set），其底集合（set）为 <MATH_0008>，作用（action）由左乘（left multiplication）给出。这个范畴（category）具有纤维积（fiber products），见范畴（Categories）第 <REF_0001> 节。\n我们规定，<MATH_0009> 是一个覆盖（covering），如果 <MATH_0010>。这就给出了 <MATH_0011> 上由覆盖（coverings）构成的一个类（class），容易看出它满足定义 <REF_0002> 的条件 (1)、(2) 和 (3)。所得结构不是位点（site），因为底层范畴（underlying category）的对象（objects）总体和覆盖（coverings）总体各自都构成真类（proper class）。我们首先将 <MATH_0012> 替换为一个完全子范畴（full subcategory）<MATH_0013>，如集合论（Sets）引理 <REF_0003> 中所述。此后所得位点（site）<MATH_0014>，是像集合论（Sets）引理 <REF_0004> 中那样适当限制覆盖（coverings）总体而得到的，我们将其记为 <MATH_0015>。\n\n<STRUCT_0001><STRUCT_0002>\n作为一个特例，如果群（group）<MATH_0016> 是可数的（countable），那么可以令 <MATH_0017> 为由可数（countable）<MATH_0018>-集合（sets）组成的范畴（category），而覆盖（coverings）取为那些联合满射的（surjective）态射族（families of morphisms）<MATH_0019>，且满足 <MATH_0020> 可数（countable）。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"group","target_term":"群"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"objects","target_term":"对象"},{"source_term":"sets","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"left","target_term":"左"},{"source_term":"action","target_term":"作用"},{"source_term":"equivariant","target_term":"等变"},{"source_term":"maps","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"set","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"set","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"action","target_term":"作用"},{"source_term":"left multiplication","target_term":"左乘"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"fiber products","target_term":"纤维积"},{"source_term":"Categories","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"coverings","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"class","target_term":"类"},{"source_term":"site","target_term":"位点"},{"source_term":"underlying category","target_term":"底层范畴"},{"source_term":"objects","target_term":"对象"},{"source_term":"coverings","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"proper class","target_term":"真类"},{"source_term":"full subcategory","target_term":"完全子范畴"},{"source_term":"Sets","target_term":"集合论"},{"source_term":"site","target_term":"位点"},{"source_term":"Sets","target_term":"集合论"},{"source_term":"coverings","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"group","target_term":"群"},{"source_term":"countable","target_term":"可数的"},{"source_term":"countable","target_term":"可数"},{"source_term":"sets","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"coverings","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"联合满射的"},{"source_term":"families of morphisms","target_term":"态射族"},{"source_term":"countable","target_term":"可数"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"group","target_term":"群","context":"带群作用的集合"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴","context":"群集所成的范畴"},{"source_term":"objects","target_term":"对象","context":"带作用的集合对象"},{"source_term":"sets","target_term":"集合","context":"带群作用的集合"},{"source_term":"left","target_term":"左","context":"群的左作用"},{"source_term":"action","target_term":"作用","context":"群在集合上的作用"},{"source_term":"equivariant","target_term":"等变","context":"与群作用相容的映射"},{"source_term":"maps","target_term":"映射","context":"等变映射"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射","context":"等变映射作为态射"},{"source_term":"set","target_term":"集合","context":"群集及底集合"},{"source_term":"left multiplication","target_term":"左乘","context":"群在自身上的作用"},{"source_term":"fiber products","target_term":"纤维积","context":"群集范畴中存在的纤维积"},{"source_term":"Categories","target_term":"范畴","context":"引用范畴章"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖","context":"像的并覆盖目标"},{"source_term":"coverings","target_term":"覆盖","context":"位点的覆盖族"},{"source_term":"class","target_term":"类","context":"覆盖的类"},{"source_term":"site","target_term":"位点","context":"缩小后得到的位点"},{"source_