{"unit_id":"tag:07GE:statement","translation":"设 <MATH_0001> 为范畴（category）。有一种典范（canonical）方式将其变成位点（site），其中 <MATHSEG_0001> 是同构（isomorphism）<MATHSEG_0002> 是 <MATH_0002> 的覆盖（coverings）。这个位点（site）上的层（Sheaves）就是 <MATH_0003> 上的预层（presheaves）。相应的拓扑（topology）称为<TEXTITOPEN_0001>混沌（chaotic）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>或<TEXTITOPEN_0002>平凡拓扑（indiscrete topology）<TEXTITCLOSE_0002>。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"canonical","target_term":"典范"},{"source_term":"site","target_term":"位点"},{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"同构"},{"source_term":"coverings","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"site","target_term":"位点"},{"source_term":"Sheaves","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"presheaves","target_term":"预层"},{"source_term":"topology","target_term":"拓扑"},{"source_term":"chaotic","target_term":"混沌"},{"source_term":"indiscrete topology","target_term":"平凡拓扑"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴","context":"赋予混沌拓扑的范畴"},{"source_term":"canonical","target_term":"典范","context":"范畴变为位点的典范方式"},{"source_term":"site","target_term":"位点","context":"仅以单个同构为覆盖的位点"},{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"同构","context":"形成覆盖的态射"},{"source_term":"coverings","target_term":"覆盖","context":"由同构组成的覆盖"},{"source_term":"Sheaves","target_term":"层","context":"这个位点上的层"},{"source_term":"presheaves","target_term":"预层","context":"此时层与所有预层一致"},{"source_term":"topology","target_term":"拓扑","context":"相应拓扑的名称"},{"source_term":"chaotic","target_term":"混沌","context":"拓扑名称之一"},{"source_term":"indiscrete topology","target_term":"平凡拓扑","context":"原文给出的另一拓扑名称，暂定译法"}],"notes":[]}
